SHA256: 7dfb07ffbfd702f28c0a784e278358f708c365f6c913f8f83e4e5258e8e287ca
Section: Tweaks
Description: SoundCloud deprecated its v1 API and the password OAuth grant this old client relies on, breaking login, playback, search, feeds and likes/reposts on iOS 6. This tweak rewrites v1 API calls to the current v2 endpoints, fixes the resulting response/field mismatches, and adds a manual credential entry screen since automated login is no longer possible. The endpoint mapping lives in a JSON file next to the tweak, editable on the device without reinstalling.
Author: kern0x1b
Name: SoundCloud iOS 6 Fix

